<h1>Automation &amp; Volunteer Tracking</h1>

<p class="lead">Volunteer hours tracking and automation that turns attendance and roster data into real reports — plus extensible actions and hooks for when you need GatherPack to fit your workflow exactly.</p>

<img src="/images/ss-directory.png" alt="GatherPack reports view showing custom reporting and automation tools" width="826" height="826" loading="lazy" style="width:100%;max-width:560px;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;" class="rounded border">

<section id="overview" class="card" aria-labelledby="overview-heading">
  <div class="card-header">
    <h2 id="overview-heading">From tracking to insight</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <p>GatherPack handles the grind: clock in/out via kiosk, period-based reporting, and custom reports that pull the answers you actually need — attendance trends, financial summaries, member activity — without exporting to yet another spreadsheet. For groups that outgrow off-the-shelf fields, power users can extend GatherPack with code snippets that automate tasks and tailor views.</p>
    <p class="mb-0">This is where the “single place” promise pays off. Because hours, events, and <a href="/features/members/">members</a> share a database, a report can answer “how did this team show up this month?” in one click.</p>
  </div>
</section>

