<section id="faq" class="card" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
  <div class="card-header">
    <h2 id="faq-heading">Automation FAQs</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <h3 class="h5">Do I need to code to use reports?</h3>
    <p>Today reports are code snippets — perfect for technical teams and for Sledgehammer-hosted groups where we can help. A no-code builder is on the roadmap so non-technical leaders can build them directly.</p>
    <h3 class="h5">What are actions and hooks?</h3>
    <p>Actions are things a person triggers (run a task with a click); hooks run automatically when a system event happens (new member, payment received). Both are planned as first-class extensibility, listed on the <a href="/roadmap/">roadmap</a>.</p>
    <h3 class="h5">Can I export the data?</h3>
    <p>Yes. Because everything lives together, you can pull roster, attendance, and finance into reports instead of stitching CSVs from three apps. See <a href="/faq/">full FAQ</a>.</p>
